globs: src/**/*.{jsx,tsx,js,ts}
alwaysApply: false
---

# React components

- Use functional components and default exports for page-level components.
- Keep UI state local with `useState`; avoid global state for this tiny app.
- Prefer plain CSS in `src/index.css` over CSS-in-JS or new styling libraries.
- Interactive overlays (modals, dialogs) should support Escape to close and a visible Close control.
- Keep JSX flat: one primary section per screen unless the user asks for more.
